s_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","review_id":"4QOoKKjsRR7rWEXr-ulYpw","date":"2013-05-19T19:30:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9435837268829346,"text_excerpt":"Hansen's is a New Orleans institution and who doesn't love a snowball on a hot day? I stopped here on a not-too-hot day and was intimidated by the line out the door, onto the sidewalk and nearly into the street. Luckily, the line moved at a steady pace and before I knew it, I was inside placing my order. They have the basic flavors here and don't really have anything super exotic. I decided on a bubblegum snowball (one of my faves). I liked that the ice was really finely shaved giving it a velvet like consistency. They were super generous with the syrup and the snowball itself was delicious. I can't wait to go back to Hansen's."},{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","review_id":"440f5lC67nVy4jhA9bmfXg","date":"2013-09-23T15:55:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9435714483261108,"text_excerpt":"OYE OYE OYE! ALL HAIL KING HANSEN'S SNO-BLIZ! I would definitely give this place 6 stars if possible. This was my first trip to Hansen's this snowball season, and it wasn't for a lack of trying. Normally there is a line of patrons extending out the door and up Bordeaux Street. I pass there at least twice weekly, waiting for a rare opportunity of not having to wait 30+ minutes for this delicious treat. The wait is totally worth it if you have a little free time; but I'm on a tight schedule these days and time is of the essence. So I find myself leaving Restaurant Wayfare and we are craving something sweet. So we turn up Napoleon, turn on Tchoupitoulas St. and low and behold, although there..."},{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","review_id":"ub7zSnLVdOUgQlhOcyLbwQ","date":"2019-07-21T12:48:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9404447078704834,"text_excerpt":"So hard to believe that I was able to get a sno-ball on a hot & sunny New Orleans afternoon...with virtually no wait! Since Hansen's makes all of their own syrups from scratch, there's no better choice for sno-balls in New Orleans! While the decor is dated, haphazard, and badly in need of a facelift, their sno-balls are on point! If you're from the northern states, you may not fully get what all the fuss is about. However, go all in and enjoy this southern summertime delight...with all the decadent toppings! Do so even if there's a long line (which is usually the case). #Hansens #SoWorthIt Instead of their delicious and creamy wedding cake (almond) syrup with added sweetened condensed mil..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","photo_id":"1G6sctycvBMRCXba8BUTiw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1G6sctycvBMRCXba8BUTiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8844597339630127},{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","photo_id":"mi8Fwr2_sTeF4W_Ocg5knA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mi8Fwr2_sTeF4W_Ocg5knA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8537118434906006},{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","photo_id":"koHIFYBUcxpJsrI3u3jq5w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/koHIFYBUcxpJsrI3u3jq5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8126527070999146},{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","photo_id":"r-miUwH3cG288oFJFAtgCg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/r-miUwH3cG288oFJFAtgCg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8112696409225464},{"business_id":"-AaxZJ_I4rSFOBJbBz4SlQ","photo_id":"FZwFgQlhJwJoFp5MzVhfGQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/FZwFgQlhJwJoFp5MzVhfGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7203627228736877}]},"notebook_case":null}
